{title: Tumse Hi Tumse}
{artist: Anjaana Anjaani Shekhar Ravjiani}
{key: Am}

{c: Verse 1}
[Am]Ab Se Koi Khu [G]Shi Nahi,        [Am]Jiski Tum Wa [G]Jah Nahi
[Am]Ab Se Koi [G]Din Nahi,        [Dm]Jiski Tum Subah Na [Am]Hi
[Am]Ab Se Koi [G]Baat Nahi,        Jo [Am]Tumse Na Ho [G]Gi Shuru
[Am]Ab Se Koi [G]Raah Nahi,        Jo [Dm]Tum Sang Main Mu [Am]Dhoon
[Dm]Ab Ke Abhi Yeh Ho Gaya Yakeen,        Yeh [G]Zindagi Meri Ho Gayi Teri
[Dm]Ab Ke Abhi Yeh Ho Gaya Yakeen,        Yeh [G]Zindagi Meri Ho Gayi Teri
[C]Tumse Hi [G]Tumse Har [Am]Baat,        Har [F]Baat Hai
[C]Jab Tum [G]Ho [Am]Saath [F],        [C]Tumse Hi [G]Tumse Har [Am]Baat
Har [F]Baat Hai,        [C]Jab Tum [G]Ho [Am]Saath [F]
[C]Sayaa Ban Ke Tera [G]Saya,        Chalunga Sang [Bb]Tere
Hai Tanha Tu [G]Nahi,        [C]Paaya Abh Bhi Dhoond [G]Paaya
Tu Jis Me Musku [Bb]Ra De,        Woh Lamha Kyu Na [G]Hi
Ab [Am]Thaam Lu Tujhe Ki Thokre Mile,        Jo Zindagi Ki [Em]Raah Me [F]
[Am]Chhupa Lu Dhoop Se,        Jahan Ki Me Le Lu Aa Tujhe Pa [C]Nah Me [G]
[Dm]Ab Ke Abhi Yeh Ho Gaya Yakeen,        Yeh [G]Zindagi Meri Ho Gayi Teri
[Dm]Ab Ke Abhi Yeh Ho Gaya Yakeen,        Yeh [G]Zindagi Meri Ho Gayi Teri
[C]Tumse Hi [G]Tumse Har [Am]Baat,        Har [F]Baat Hai
[C]Jab Tum [G]Ho [Am]Saath [F],        [C]Tumse Hi [G]Tumse Har [Am]Baat
Har [F]Baat Hai,        [C]Jab Tum [G]Ho [Am]Saath [F]
[C]Anjaana Tha, Ehmiyat Se [G]Teri,        Yaar Mera Guzra [F]Kal
Kab [C]Jaana Tha Tere Vaaste,        Hi Aaj Se [G]Hoga Har Pal
Main Karta Hoon, Yeh Ilte [F]Ja,        Phir Se Jeena Seekh [G]Le Zara
Ooh [Dm]Ab Ke Abhi Yeh Ho Gaya Yakeen,        Yeh [G]Zindagi Meri Ho Gayi Teri
[Dm]Ab Ke Abhi Yeh Ho Gaya Yakeen,        Yeh [G]Zindagi Meri Ho Gayi Teri
[C]Tumse Hi [G]Tumse Har [Am]Baat,        Har [F]Baat Hai
[C]Jab Tum [G]Ho [Am]Saath [F],        [C]Tumse Hi [G]Tumse Har [Am]Baat
Har [F]Baat Hai,        [C]Jab Tum [G]Ho [Am]Saath [F]
